Receipt-ingesting PR cockpit director

Usage: cockpitctl <COMMAND>

Commands:
  ingest    Ingest sensor receipts under artifacts/ and render a cockpit report + comment
  init      Write a starter cockpit.toml (does not overwrite)
  validate  Validate a receipt file can be parsed (developer tool)
  explain   Explain a cockpit finding code (e.g. cockpit.missing_receipt)
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
